 with one click and you can set how many requests the gateway accepts any time window and you pick

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.720
 fixed or sliding fixed resets on the clock say every 10 minutes sliding counts the last 10 minutes

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:09.040
 whenever a request comes in. So these rate limiting options are here. So this is a way to this is a

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:15.600
 cap on requests, not a cap on dollars. So seeing that spend is great and being able to have a cap

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:19.280
 on the number of requests is nice as well and caching can save you money. But now I want to

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:24.560
 look at the spend limits as well right underneath here. These are spend limits. It's a dollar budget

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:31.200
 either per month or per window. And right now I have this on a the interns. We have a fixed budget

